WEBVTT

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.080
Hey, let's do this!

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.210
Diving? Okay!

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.090
--I'll pass.
--Hey, Yui, are you sure it's okay that I came?

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.800
Yeah, Sara and Tia both said
they want you to come...

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.260
And I wanted to have
some time to chat with you.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.350
You little cutie-pie!
Ooja booja boo!

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.400
Aw, come on, Retty!

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.660
Hey!

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.530
I told you not to push!

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:38.830
Go!

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.240
Wait a se--

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.420
Sheesh...

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.090
I can't believe a little softy like you

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.800
can turn into a massive,
armored, giant... Hmm...

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.050
Hey! Retsu, me too!

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.890
Hey, so what in the world are you guys?

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.310
We're Regalia!

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.100
Rega-- What's that?

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:11.190
I dunno!

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.900
Wh-What?! So what were you
doing before you came here?

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.070
We were looking for Rena and Kei!

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:21.950
Kei? Who's that? Are there
more of you little cuties?!

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.330
Um...

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.620
Yeah! But no matter how long
we looked, we never found 'em!

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:29.840
How long did you look?

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.840
Hmm...

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.340
A long time!

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.010
Rena and Kei are really good
at hide and seek, huh?

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.430
Yeah!

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:42.890
I'd guess about... 2,000 years.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.310
What...

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:49.770
Well, they're cute,
so it's all right. Ooja booja!

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:52.610
--Ooja booja wooja!
--Aaah!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.110
Let's go.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.660
One, two, three...

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:10.910
Hanging out like this makes last night
seem like a weird dream or something.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.170
But it really happened, didn't it...

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.590
Yui...

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:21.340
Hey!

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.050
What are you two doing?

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.050
Aren't you gonna get in?

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:29.760
Yeah. We're just taking in
the view. It's so pretty.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.220
The view?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:40.060
Yeah, it's pretty. But I know a
lot of other pretty places, too!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.490
Right, Sara?

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:46.910
Yeah! We saw a lot of different places
while we were looking for Rena and Kei!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.000
Do you think we could hear about it?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:03.420
Tisis... Another Regalia,
and the one bound to it.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.840
According to Yui,
they are not our enemy.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.930
--Yui!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:13.310
Welcome!

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.440
Your house is huge!

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.600
Really huge!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.230
It's not really my house.

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:24.610
They seemed quite comfortable around Yui.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:27.610
There's someone from another
country that wants to see Yui!

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:28.660
Again?

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:31.200
I told you, if one country is given
priority in granting audiences,

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.040
it's going to cause problems for
the ministry of foreign affairs...

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.460
Oh, well, this one's a bit different...

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:47.300
So, you two were looking
for Rena for 2,000 years?

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:48.470
Yeah!

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.470
We don't age!

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.140
Right?

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.560
So, you don't either?

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:57.810
Rena--

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.980
Sara, Tia, give me a hand!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.610
--Okay!

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:20.960
Rena.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:30.590
I think I was lonely...

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:35.300
Tia had Sara... But I didn't have anyone...

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.850
I wanted someone to keep me company.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:45.560
But no matter how hard I looked,
I still ended up all alone.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:51.900
That's why I was so happy
to meet your mom and dad.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.200
They made me a part of their family.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:02.830
I always wondered why my body was like this.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.920
But now I'm glad that I'm a Regalia.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.970
Because I got to meet you.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.380
Rena...

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.550
Hey!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.390
Dinner's ready!

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.390
Let's go.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.810
Okay-

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.310
"incoming Call"
"Aoi"

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:28.440
Hi! Yeah, we're about to have dinner--

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:36.870
Hey, What's going on?

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:40.250
They said there's a Regalia
and she wants to meet us.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.710
Oh, wow!

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:42.830
Can we?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.210
Is it that Kei person you mentioned earlier?

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.960
I guess not.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.920
Huh? So there are others besides you guys?

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.050
Yeah!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:54.800
But it's the first time we'll
meet one besides us!

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:58.350
You traveled for 2,000
years and didn't meet one?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.310
You're right! Weird, huh?

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:01.730
Yeah!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:07.770
I think I'm going to go.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.570
Yay, I can't wait!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.400
Let's go!

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.740
You look like you've
already decided.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.490
Yeah.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:18.660
You two still haven't made
enough to cover your bill!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.290
When you come back, you'll have
to make up for the break!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.960
What?!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.040
Okay! Let's eat!

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.500
It's kind of turned into a family dinner.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:31.170
--Wow!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.630
It's more fancy than normal!

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.630
--What?! It's always fancy!
--Looks delicious!

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.930
--It's definitely fancier!
--Hey!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:11.210
It was hard enough getting out
of the palace; I never thought

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:14.300
we'd be going to another
country at a time like this!

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:16.720
I'm sorry, Aoi. But...

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:21.260
It's okay, I understand.
Nothing is actually happening,

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:24.180
and I'm sure you're
making the right decision.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:27.270
Things surely won't be resolved
unless something is done.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:31.150
If they are a Regalia, I think
you should meet them, too.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:34.110
Yui, look!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.360
It looks like we've arrived.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.040
We've been looking forward to
your arrival, Your Highness.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:48.750
I am Karim Al Talaqy, President
of the Republic of Afmaraldo.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.040
It is an honor to meet you,
Mr. President.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.210
Likewise, Your Highness.

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.720
Please, come with me.

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:58.130
Okay-

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.640
This area has long been
revered as hallowed ground.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:08.310
Our people have lived with
them for many generations.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.600
Them?

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.820
Please, wait inside.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:17.360
Only those called forward
by the Regalia can enter.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:19.740
I understand.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.620
I'll be right back.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:23.700
Yui...

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.330
Be careful.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.130
This seems like the kind of
place where monsters would live.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.390
Totally!

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.660
Are these all Regalia?

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:06.450
Are they all stuck like this?

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.080
Why?

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.500
Let's go.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:19.300
How pretty! I can't believe this
was on the other side of the cave.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:22.470
Whoa! I'm gonna get a closer look!

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.430
Me too!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:29.100
That Regalia that wanted to meet us...
I wonder what they're like.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:33.520
I've never met any Regalia
other than us, either.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:37.320
Hey! There's a Regalia over here, too!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.530
I wonder if it's stuck, too.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.910
Sara! Tia!

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:50.710
You mustn't surprise them, Lowe.
They're our welcome guests.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:59.630
I am Ryu. Nice to meet you,
Regalia of Erinius.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.760
Erinius?

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:10.350
Lowe, we've finally met them.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:16.900
Lowe is Enki's Regalia. I am bound to them.

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.980
Wow! Sara, its name is Lowe!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:20.990
I'm Sara!

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.450
I'm Tia!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:25.570
I am Rena Asteria.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:26.570
Thanks.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:30.790
Nice to meet you, Ryu and Lowe.
My name is Yui.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:37.750
Hmm? Maybe she's a little shy. Lowe!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.420
Lowe is a man.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.210
Huh?!

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.050
We're engaged.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:46.260
I'm s-sorry! I just assumed...

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:53.390
Oomph! Hmph! Hee-hee!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:58.690
This is a beautiful place.
It's so relaxing.

00:12:58.900 --> 00:12:59.820
Thank you.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:03.070
It's strange... It's desert outside,
and yet there's a very

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:05.450
bountiful spring right here.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:08.240
That is the power of Enki's Regalia.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:13.830
Lowe can bring out the blessing
of water wherever he goes.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:19.040
People that are chosen
as the core of a Regalia,

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.130
and those bound to them,
bringing out their true power...

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:25.260
Together, they brought great
blessings to the people.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.510
Bringing the power of
the gods to this world...

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.220
That is what it is to be a Regalia.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.140
So, Rena and others also...

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:37.850
Erinius... Three Regalia,
governing the power of revenge.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:41.900
Revenge?

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:46.610
Erinius is a Regalia that
was created for combat.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:53.450
Its massive, fearsome power was
used to seal something away.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.580
Something?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.710
Lux Ex Machina.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:13.850
The same image over and over; how boring.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.310
Hey, why don't we attack the castle?

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:22.230
Tisis must be with them,
and Alecto's right arm came back,

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:25.360
so there's no need to wait around, right?

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:27.530
I don't think they're at the castle anymore.

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:30.320
How about we throw a
little fit in the city, then?

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:33.910
She's sure to freak out and show up!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:38.620
Come on! It'd be over quick with your Regalia.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.460
Well, if you don't want to go...

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:48.090
Born in light, binding darkness,
arbiter of truth...

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.880
Sum it!

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.340
...dwelling within me,

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:55.180
--Well, whatever.
--reveal the false purgatory...

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.810
I'm going.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:03.980
I've got a new gear now.
You don't mind if I look for her, right?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:08.900
Ingrid?

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.380
Lux Ex Machina's massive
power swallowed up my family,

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:29.090
my friends, and everything else in this world.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:36.010
Many Regalia from around
the world went to his domain

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:40.720
to try to stop him,
but none of them returned.

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:46.270
But Lowe and I saved
our friends that remain here.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:50.940
Lux Ex Machina was sealed away
before it could swallow everything.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.360
Sealed?

00:15:56.740 --> 00:16:01.200
The human race entrusted the power
of Erinius, god of revenge,

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:05.910
to the last three people
accepted by the Regalia...

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:10.710
...to seal away Lux Ex Machina.
That was a long, long time ago.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:22.060
We haven't felt the presence
of any Regalia since.

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:27.730
Yet after many thousands of years,
we felt your power again.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:32.110
Rimgarde and Enastoria!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:36.280
"Ah, that must be Erinius' Regalia," we thought.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:40.750
So we asked Mr. Talaqy to
try to get you to come here.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:45.420
Actually, we should have come ourselves,
but Lowe can't move anymore.

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:48.840
So, why did you...

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:53.550
I am truly sorry to have made you
carry this burden on your own.

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:59.130
And I thank you. It's because of you
that we are able to live like this.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:03.640
Thank you. Thank you so much.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.760
What about all the others?

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:38.050
Yeah, there are so many Regalia!
How come they don't move?

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.010
Are they sleeping?

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:42.430
They have all left this world.

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:44.680
Huh?

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.890
Regalia don't die!

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:54.400
They fulfilled their roles
and quietly slipped away.

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:59.860
Lowe kept giving water to all
the things they left behind...

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.200
But he has very little power left.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:06.830
He hasn't been able to return to
his original form for some time.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.960
Regalia do die...

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:16.710
We had hoped to return this
land to its former lushness,

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:21.640
but we couldn't do that with
the power that remained.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:26.350
But the people still love this land
and live on with strength.

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:30.310
So why are you still able to use that power?

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:34.860
This place is proof that we
Regalia were once alive.

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:38.650
Protecting this place and
watching over its people

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.120
made Lowe and me very happy.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:45.820
We plan to let the water flow
until we are reunited with everyone.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:51.290
But this was the path we
found to our happiness.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.130
You all must find your own.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:19:00.760
You have sacrificed for our happiness.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:05.430
I want you all to find true happiness.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:09.690
That is our final wish.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:11.400
Ooh, I'm jealous!

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:12.730
Me too!

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:35.840
Wow...

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.460
How beautiful!

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:08.040
Yui...

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:10.830
I want to see for myself just
what happened in Rimgarde,

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:14.710
and what happened to you.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:19.420
If I do that, I think I will understand
what Ingrid is trying to do.

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:26.220
We will arrive in Rimgarde soon.

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.640
Okay-

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.360
Found you!

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.150
What the hell is AWACS doing?!

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:41.610
They said it just showed up on radar...

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:44.320
What just happened?!

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:45.450
What is it now?

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:48.910
The aft ramp section is losing pressure!

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:50.120
No way...

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.870
Is this really okay?

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.580
It's fine, it's fine!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.000
This is a bit higher than in the pool!

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:03.340
Yui...

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:05.010
Let's go, Rena.

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:06.300
Okay-

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:07.930
Sara, Tia!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:08.760
Okay!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.180
Roger!

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:21.400
Ha ha! She's a load of fun!
